──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
This is the "Astra VB6 Inventory Sample" — a Nous-authored calibration
corpus for the Phase 10 VB6 migration pipeline. It is NOT extracted from
any customer codebase. The forms, modules, and classes exercise every VB6-
specific claim kind defined by vb6.schema.json and every trap in the
Phase 10.0.e Golden Dataset, so the spec extractor and equivalence
sidecar can be calibrated against a stable, representative target before
engagement teams point them at real customer code.
